    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "dude i think something is actually happening. i was watching the charts during that sudden drop earlier today and my heart literally started racing in the exact same pattern as the candles hitting the support level. like it wasnt just anxiety, it felt like my body was actually reacting to the volume spikes before they even showed up on the screen. anyone else ever felt this kind of sync with the volatility?",
