    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even if its speculative, i actually made a profit on a scalp trade because i felt the spike in my chest before the news even hit. if i can figure out how to stabilize my breathing or stay in that specific state, could i use that to anticipate the next volatility event? like how can i optimize my biological signals to better read the market flow?",
